type: software
title: "DCE-design: experimental designs for discrete choice experiments in MATLAB"
abstract: "Efficient (D-error; multinomial logit, cross-sectional and panel mixed logit, weighted models, Bayesian priors), orthogonal and full factorial designs for discrete choice experiments, with constraints, balanced blocking, evaluation of existing designs and a translator for Ngene scripts."
